  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How to read the arrows",
      "items": [
        "Arrow = static Python import of another module's package (A → B: A imports B), collected from `from dawam.modules.X` in each module's code.",
        "Only the transitive reduction is drawn: an import implied by a longer drawn path is omitted. The complete list is in the next two cards.",
        "Not drawn: platform kernel imports (every module may use dawam.platform) and composition roots (app.py, worker.py, wiring.py, job_handlers.py)."
      ]
    },
